WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.550
Read this sentence.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.570
You see the words, you understand
them, and you remember how it began.

3
00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:09.510
Different parts of your
brain have different jobs:

4
00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:13.590
thought, movement, heart
rate, body temperature.

5
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:17.520
And your brain holds about
86 billion nerve cells.

6
00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:21.720
So how do separate parts
add up to one thinking mind?

7
00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:25.960
In this mission, you'll find the main
parts of the brain and match each one to

8
00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:27.090
its job.

9
00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:31.950
Then you'll use clues from what a person
can and cannot do to work out which part

10
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.930
of the brain is responsible.

11
00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:37.520
Your mission: explain how
separate parts of your brain,

12
00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:41.170
with separate jobs, add
up to one thinking mind.
